[
  {
    "sentence_id": 1,
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.0,
    "text": "Hey there!"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 2,
    "start": 2.0,
    "end": 4.06,
    "text": "Grab a warm drink,"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 3,
    "start": 4.06,
    "end": 7.84,
    "text": "sit back, and relax for a moment."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 4,
    "start": 7.84,
    "end": 10.4,
    "text": "Let me ask you something honest."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 5,
    "start": 10.4,
    "end": 12.88,
    "text": "Have you ever had a completely free day?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 6,
    "start": 12.88,
    "end": 15.51,
    "text": "A day where you did no hard labor"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 7,
    "start": 15.51,
    "end": 17.81,
    "text": "you lifted no heavy weights"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 8,
    "start": 17.81,
    "end": 19.96,
    "text": "and you ran no marathons."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 9,
    "start": 19.96,
    "end": 21.84,
    "text": "You just stayed home."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 10,
    "start": 21.84,
    "end": 23.71,
    "text": "You laid on the sofa,"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 11,
    "start": 23.71,
    "end": 27.18,
    "text": "scrolled your phone, watched some shows"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 12,
    "start": 27.18,
    "end": 28.96,
    "text": "and tried to rest."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 13,
    "start": 28.96,
    "end": 32.62,
    "text": "And yet, by eight o'clock in the evening"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 14,
    "start": 32.62,
    "end": 36.28,
    "text": "you felt completely utterly exhausted."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 15,
    "start": 36.28,
    "end": 39.08,
    "text": "Your limbs felt heavy like lead."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 16,
    "start": 39.08,
    "end": 41.36,
    "text": "Your brain felt foggy."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 17,
    "start": 41.36,
    "end": 44.6,
    "text": "Your chest felt strangely empty."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 18,
    "start": 44.6,
    "end": 47.58,
    "text": "You asked yourself, why am I so"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 19,
    "start": 47.58,
    "end": 51.72,
    "text": "tired when I literally did nothing all day?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 20,
    "start": 51.72,
    "end": 53.85,
    "text": "Most people think this is just"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 21,
    "start": 53.85,
    "end": 56.2,
    "text": "laziness or a lack of motivation."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 22,
    "start": 56.2,
    "end": 57.72,
    "text": "You know this."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 23,
    "start": 57.72,
    "end": 61.72,
    "text": "But the reality is far deeper."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 24,
    "start": 61.72,
    "end": 64.52,
    "text": "What you're experiencing is one of the most fascinating"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 25,
    "start": 64.52,
    "end": 66.04,
    "text": "invisible biological battles"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 26,
    "start": 66.03999999999999,
    "end": 69.2,
    "text": "happening inside human physiology."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 27,
    "start": 69.2,
    "end": 70.92,
    "text": "It is called the"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 28,
    "start": 70.92,
    "end": 73.72,
    "text": "paradox of mental fatigue."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 29,
    "start": 73.72,
    "end": 74.66,
    "text": "And to understand it,"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 30,
    "start": 74.66,
    "end": 77.72,
    "text": "we have to look at the silent energy thief running in the background"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 31,
    "start": 77.72,
    "end": 79.52,
    "text": "of your skull."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 32,
    "start": 79.52,
    "end": 82.56,
    "text": "Let's look at the numbers."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 33,
    "start": 82.56,
    "end": 85.48,
    "text": "Your brain weighs only about three pounds."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 34,
    "start": 85.48,
    "end": 87.4,
    "text": "That is just two percent"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 35,
    "start": 87.4,
    "end": 89.48,
    "text": "of your total body weight."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 36,
    "start": 89.48,
    "end": 91.63,
    "text": "But that tiny clump of tissue consumes 20"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 37,
    "start": 91.63,
    "end": 94.0,
    "text": "percent of all the oxygen and glucose in your"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 38,
    "start": 94.0,
    "end": 95.76,
    "text": "entire body."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 39,
    "start": 95.76,
    "end": 97.37,
    "text": "Every fifth breath you take,"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 40,
    "start": 97.37,
    "end": 99.45,
    "text": "and every fifth bite of food you eat"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 41,
    "start": 99.45,
    "end": 101.0,
    "text": "goes directly to powering"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 42,
    "start": 101.0,
    "end": 104.08,
    "text": "the electrical storm inside your head."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 43,
    "start": 104.08,
    "end": 107.72,
    "text": "Now, here's the mystery."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 44,
    "start": 107.72,
    "end": 109.51,
    "text": "When you sit down to do nothing"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 45,
    "start": 109.51,
    "end": 112.52,
    "text": "how much energy do you think your brain's sitting?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 46,
    "start": 112.52,
    "end": 113.92,
    "text": "It saves."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 47,
    "start": 113.92,
    "end": 118.81,
    "text": "Most people assume the brain drops its energy consumption by 50 or 80 percent"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 48,
    "start": 118.81,
    "end": 119.76,
    "text": "like a laptop"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 49,
    "start": 119.75999999999999,
    "end": 122.44,
    "text": "entering sleep mode."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 50,
    "start": 122.44,
    "end": 126.6,
    "text": "In 1997, a groundbreaking neuroscientist named Dr."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 51,
    "start": 126.6,
    "end": 129.76,
    "text": "Marcus Reichel ran brain scans to find"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 52,
    "start": 129.76,
    "end": 130.92,
    "text": "out."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 53,
    "start": 130.92,
    "end": 135.32,
    "text": "What he discovered shocked the scientific community."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 54,
    "start": 135.32,
    "end": 138.49,
    "text": "When you stop doing tasks and sit in a room doing nothing"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 55,
    "start": 138.49,
    "end": 140.32,
    "text": "your brain's energy consumption"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 56,
    "start": 140.32,
    "end": 143.4,
    "text": "drops by less than 5 percent."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 57,
    "start": 143.4,
    "end": 145.54,
    "text": "95 percent of your mental power"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 58,
    "start": 145.54,
    "end": 147.88,
    "text": "is still running at full throttle."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 59,
    "start": 147.88,
    "end": 150.44,
    "text": "Why?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 60,
    "start": 150.44,
    "end": 152.16,
    "text": "Because your brain does"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 61,
    "start": 152.16,
    "end": 153.88,
    "text": "not have an off switch."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 62,
    "start": 153.88,
    "end": 156.35,
    "text": "When you stop focusing on the outside world"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 63,
    "start": 156.35,
    "end": 159.0,
    "text": "your brain boots up a massive interconnected"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 64,
    "start": 159.0,
    "end": 161.4,
    "text": "neural network."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 65,
    "start": 161.4,
    "end": 166.38,
    "text": "Neuroscientists call it the default"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 66,
    "start": 166.38,
    "end": 169.8,
    "text": "mode network or the DMN."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 67,
    "start": 169.8,
    "end": 170.98,
    "text": "Think of the DMN as"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 68,
    "start": 170.98,
    "end": 173.6,
    "text": "your brain's internal time travel machine."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 69,
    "start": 173.6,
    "end": 177.59,
    "text": "The moment you are not actively solving a puzzle or talking to someone"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 70,
    "start": 177.59,
    "end": 178.44,
    "text": "the DMN takes"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 71,
    "start": 178.44,
    "end": 180.0,
    "text": "over."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 72,
    "start": 180.0,
    "end": 181.66,
    "text": "It starts replaying past"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 73,
    "start": 181.66,
    "end": 184.08,
    "text": "embarrassments from five years ago."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 74,
    "start": 184.08,
    "end": 186.49,
    "text": "It starts simulating future disasters"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 75,
    "start": 186.49,
    "end": 188.24,
    "text": "that have not happened yet."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 76,
    "start": 188.24,
    "end": 189.7,
    "text": "It starts comparing you"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 77,
    "start": 189.7,
    "end": 191.36,
    "text": "to people on social media."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 78,
    "start": 191.36,
    "end": 193.52,
    "text": "It starts wondering, did"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 79,
    "start": 193.52,
    "end": 195.68,
    "text": "I reply to that message?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 80,
    "start": 195.68,
    "end": 198.36,
    "text": "What am I doing with my life?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 81,
    "start": 198.36,
    "end": 201.48000000000002,
    "text": "Am I falling behind?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 82,
    "start": 201.48,
    "end": 203.7,
    "text": "Your brain is running hundreds"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 83,
    "start": 203.7,
    "end": 206.88,
    "text": "of heavy psychological simulations at once."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 84,
    "start": 206.88,
    "end": 210.09,
    "text": "To your body, a simulated threat feels"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 85,
    "start": 210.09,
    "end": 213.72,
    "text": "nearly identical to a real physical threat."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 86,
    "start": 213.72,
    "end": 217.29,
    "text": "When you imagine an uncomfortable conversation or worry about tomorrow"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 87,
    "start": 217.29,
    "end": 218.36,
    "text": "your brain releases"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 88,
    "start": 218.36,
    "end": 221.84,
    "text": "microdoses of cortisol and adrenaline."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 89,
    "start": 221.84,
    "end": 225.12,
    "text": "Your heart rate subtly elevates."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 90,
    "start": 225.12,
    "end": 228.44,
    "text": "Your muscles tense up."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 91,
    "start": 228.44,
    "end": 231.89,
    "text": "You might be lying completely still on a soft bed"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 92,
    "start": 231.89,
    "end": 234.64,
    "text": "but biologically, your nervous system"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 93,
    "start": 234.64,
    "end": 235.78,
    "text": "is running a"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 94,
    "start": 235.78,
    "end": 239.2,
    "text": "marathon against imaginary phantoms."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 95,
    "start": 239.20000000000002,
    "end": 241.76,
    "text": "And then comes the second energy leak."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 96,
    "start": 241.76,
    "end": 243.64000000000001,
    "text": "The illusion of rest."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 97,
    "start": 243.64,
    "end": 245.77,
    "text": "When we feel tired today,"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 98,
    "start": 245.77,
    "end": 246.96,
    "text": "what do we do?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 99,
    "start": 246.96,
    "end": 249.20000000000002,
    "text": "We reach for our phones."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 100,
    "start": 249.2,
    "end": 251.52,
    "text": "We tell ourselves,"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 101,
    "start": 251.52,
    "end": 253.84,
    "text": "I'm just relaxing."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 102,
    "start": 253.84,
    "end": 256.37,
    "text": "But scrolling through short-form videos"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 103,
    "start": 256.37,
    "end": 257.8,
    "text": "and feeds is not rest."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 104,
    "start": 257.8,
    "end": 260.44,
    "text": "It is sensory overload."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 105,
    "start": 260.44,
    "end": 264.46,
    "text": "Every three seconds, your brain has to process a new face"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 106,
    "start": 264.46,
    "end": 265.37,
    "text": "a new song,"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 107,
    "start": 265.37,
    "end": 266.36,
    "text": "a new emotion,"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 108,
    "start": 266.36,
    "end": 268.83,
    "text": "a new piece of news,"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 109,
    "start": 268.83,
    "end": 271.8,
    "text": "and a new advertisement."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 110,
    "start": 271.8,
    "end": 275.24,
    "text": "Cognitive scientists call this micro-decision fatigue."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 111,
    "start": 275.24,
    "end": 278.31,
    "text": "Your brain has to subconsciously decide"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 112,
    "start": 278.31,
    "end": 280.12,
    "text": "do I care about this?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 113,
    "start": 280.12,
    "end": 281.6,
    "text": "Do I swipe?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 114,
    "start": 281.6,
    "end": 282.96,
    "text": "Do I laugh?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 115,
    "start": 282.96,
    "end": 284.32,
    "text": "Do I keep watching?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 116,
    "start": 284.32,
    "end": 286.48,
    "text": "You're forcing your visual and emotional"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 117,
    "start": 286.48,
    "end": 289.28,
    "text": "centers to make thousands of rapid micro-evaluations"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 118,
    "start": 289.28,
    "end": 291.4,
    "text": "every single minute."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 119,
    "start": 291.4,
    "end": 294.08,
    "text": "You're not resting your battery."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 120,
    "start": 294.08,
    "end": 296.46,
    "text": "You are violently draining it"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 121,
    "start": 296.46,
    "end": 299.0,
    "text": "while holding it in your hands."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 122,
    "start": 299.0,
    "end": 301.79999999999995,
    "text": "This is the great paradox of modern life."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 123,
    "start": 301.8,
    "end": 304.51,
    "text": "We have eliminated physical exhaustion only"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 124,
    "start": 304.51,
    "end": 307.4,
    "text": "to replace it with chronic cognitive friction."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 125,
    "start": 307.4,
    "end": 310.15,
    "text": "In 1670, the French philosopher Blaise Pascal"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 126,
    "start": 310.15,
    "end": 312.72,
    "text": "wrote a sentence that predicted the entire"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 127,
    "start": 312.72,
    "end": 314.6,
    "text": "modern era."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 128,
    "start": 314.6,
    "end": 317.48,
    "text": "He said, all of humanity's problems stem from"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 129,
    "start": 317.48,
    "end": 320.04,
    "text": "man's inability to sit quietly in a room"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 130,
    "start": 320.04,
    "end": 322.56,
    "text": "alone."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 131,
    "start": 322.56,
    "end": 325.56,
    "text": "We have become terrified of silence."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 132,
    "start": 325.56,
    "end": 327.44,
    "text": "We have forgotten the difference"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 133,
    "start": 327.44,
    "end": 329.44,
    "text": "between numbing out and true rest."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 134,
    "start": 329.44000000000005,
    "end": 332.04,
    "text": "Numbing out is passive consumption."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 135,
    "start": 332.04,
    "end": 334.14,
    "text": "It fills the silence with noise so"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 136,
    "start": 334.14,
    "end": 336.68,
    "text": "you don't have to hear your own thoughts."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 137,
    "start": 336.68,
    "end": 338.68,
    "text": "But it leaves you drained."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 138,
    "start": 338.68,
    "end": 341.32000000000005,
    "text": "True rest is restorative stillness."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 139,
    "start": 341.32,
    "end": 343.6,
    "text": "It is doing something that lets"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 140,
    "start": 343.6,
    "end": 346.76,
    "text": "your nervous system finally drop its guard."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 141,
    "start": 346.76,
    "end": 348.03,
    "text": "So how do you"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 142,
    "start": 348.03,
    "end": 350.76,
    "text": "stop the silent energy leak?"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 143,
    "start": 350.76,
    "end": 354.77,
    "text": "First, you must understand that your brain recharges through stillness"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 144,
    "start": 354.77,
    "end": 355.8,
    "text": "nature, and deep"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 145,
    "start": 355.8,
    "end": 360.24,
    "text": "presence, not digital entertainment."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 146,
    "start": 360.24,
    "end": 362.14,
    "text": "Take ten minutes today to stare"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 147,
    "start": 362.14,
    "end": 364.04,
    "text": "at a window without your phone."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 148,
    "start": 364.04,
    "end": 365.06,
    "text": "Feel the weight of"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 149,
    "start": 365.06,
    "end": 366.36,
    "text": "your feet on the floor."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 150,
    "start": 366.36,
    "end": 368.34,
    "text": "Go for a walk without headphones and"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 151,
    "start": 368.34,
    "end": 370.6,
    "text": "listen to the ambient rhythm of the wind."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 152,
    "start": 370.6,
    "end": 372.56,
    "text": "Take your default mode network,"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 153,
    "start": 372.56,
    "end": 374.96,
    "text": "settle down like dust in a quiet room."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 154,
    "start": 374.96,
    "end": 377.99,
    "text": "Give your mind permission to simply exist without evaluating"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 155,
    "start": 377.99,
    "end": 379.56,
    "text": "without reacting, and without"
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 156,
    "start": 379.56,
    "end": 382.20000000000005,
    "text": "performing."
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 157,
    "start": 382.20000000000005,
